TEXT 40 80 Left 2 !.param IN=0.5 PHIN=0.735 a=0.75 b={1-a} m=9\n \n*.step param m list 7 9 11 ; m = 7,9,11\n*.step param a list 0.3 0.75\n \ne1 i  0 VALUE={ IN * ( a* (v(phi)/PHIN) + b* (v(phi)/PHIN)**m) } tripdv=1 tripdt=1\n \nv1 phi 0 pwl 0s 0v 1s {3*PHIN}
TEXT 40 56 Left 2 ;Attention: Exponent = ** instead of ^  !!!!
